data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_00637fa56fb2d18f016aca7bde44c487d28de1e195fcd89554","output_index":0,"sequence_number":83,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating migration summaries**\n\nI’m considering how to implement migration summaries. I think I need to focus on numeric archived summaries and simplify the numeric API. There’s also a need to use boolean values effectively in the project serializer. I’ll need to add an archived boolean for queries and count adjustments. Plus, I'll be testing to ensure the expected summaries align with the end results. It's definitely a bit of a balancing act!"}

